cat << EOF
libime is the generic input method engine library behind Fcitx5. It
provides the language model, the dictionary format and the pinyin/table
decoders used by fcitx5-chinese-addons.

The package also builds the Simplified Chinese language model, dictionary
and table data that the pinyin engine needs at runtime.
EOF
